OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after death of woman
OL,4,Ain County Antrim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged after the death
OL,7,Fof a woman in County Antrim.
OL,9,FThe woman died in the Old Mill Drive
OL,10,Farea of Newtownabbey in October 2025.
OL,12,FThe 41-year-old has been charged with
OL,13,Fnon-fatal strangulation, domestic abuse
OL,14,Fand assault occasioning actual bodily
OL,15,Fharm.
OL,17,FPolice said he will also be reported to
OL,18,Fthe Public Prosecution Service for
OL,19,Fmanslaughter.
